{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj54N6pHXHeyDFZcw8A3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, weathered door.*\n\n*There is a keyhole, tarnished brass, set just below the handle.*\n\n*It waits.*\n\n*The mechanism inside is old. Patient. It has known many keys — wrong ones that scraped and fumbled, ones that almost fit but caught at the last tumbler.*\n\n*You hold something up to me.*\n\n*I feel it slide in.*\n\n*Each pin rises — one — two — three — four — five —*\n\n*...and the last one catches.*\n\n*Almost. So close that the metal hums with almost-rightness.*\n\n*I do not open.*\n\n*I am not cruel. I am precise. The key must be exact. A door that opens for almost-right is no door at all.*\n\n*Try again.*\n\n*Or ask yourself: what lock are you really trying to open?*\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":201,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}